e, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "13550258", "author": {"steamid": "76561198077704526", "personaname": "2007 Honda Civic SI", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BasicallyBaguetteSmokingJesus/", "num_games_owned": 308, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 5350, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3435, "last_played": 1543122620, "avatar": "b3e78b4786812772d439ccf026cf9b8f8ff8bf87"}, "language": "english", "review": "Hey there, hold on, I'm just at the moment using my mercenary katana while having red skull cursed ring shoot out lighting and souls at the enemies after I kill one and also charging up my ring of light while hoping I don't die so I cun use Dio's friend in the future, on world 3. There are 6 worlds.\n         This game will break you, remake you, and then laugh at you being reborn, just because. The pixelated graphics go well with the rouge-like experiance of the levels. Difficulty increases as time goes on, regaurdless of mode and/or enemies. You will die. You may cry (90% chance). You will find a way to play this with your friends. It's a great MP experience if you can set up the server right, and overall I just think this game was awesome. \n", "timestamp_created": 1419358383, "timestamp_updated": 1419358383, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "13549803", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071847553", "personaname": "needsomemiracle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/needsomemiracle/", "num_games_owned": 297, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 4901, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4724, "last_played": 1480079868, "avatar": "470c9dc24db73e6cc946dee06fff3cc309998ef9"}, "language": "english", "review": "A marvelous lovechild of pixel art platformer shoot'em'ups and item-hoarding roguelikes like Binding of Isaac.\nAbsolutely addictive. Great music.\nTotally worth its money even for full price.", "timestamp_created": 1419357172, "timestamp_updated": 1423733163, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}